			description: [
				"The mechanical workshop can move and shape materials. Industry begins when you can produce engineered fuels, steel, electrical power, and fluids at territory scale."
				"Craft the Engineer's Hammer and assemble a Coke Oven. The multiblock is the first piece of infrastructure too large to mistake for a crafting-table upgrade."
			]
			id: "17EDED4219E63841"
