			description: [
				"Mekanism enters after the first grid as the chemistry and advanced processing system. Begin with the Metallurgic Infuser and a basic control circuit."
				"Its machines are not the source of the first electricity or steel; they expand an industry you already built."
			]
			id: "367FB1BDE75C637B"
